  "prefLabel": "En 1018.06 Additional Equipment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1018.06 Additional Equipment. Additional protection equipment not included with the interconnection equipment package may be required at the utility’s discretion as long as the operational performance of an applicant’s DER is not negatively impacted and the applicant is not charged for any equipment that provides protection that is already identified in the approved interconnection equipment.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
